+"""鏁板瓧鐥呬汉缁熶竴鍔犺浇 鈥?鍏ㄩ儴 UI 娓叉煋鍣ㄥ叡鐢ㄧ殑鍞竴鍏ュ彛.
+
+patients.json 鏀寔涓ょ椤跺眰鏍煎紡:
+  - dict: {"total": N, "patients": [...]}
+  - list: [...]
+"""
+
+from __future__ import annotations
+
+import json
+import logging
+from pathlib import Path
+
+logger = logging.getLogger(__name__)
+
+PROJECT_ROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent.parent.parent
+PATIENTS_FILE = PROJECT_ROOT / "packages" / "haip-hospital" / "data" / "patients.json"
+
+
+def load_patients(agent_name: str, limit: int = 8, only_compatible: bool = False) -> list[dict]:
+    """鍔犺浇涓?agent 鍏煎鐨勬暟瀛楃梾浜?
+
+    Args:
+        agent_name: Agent 鎶€鏈悕, 鍖归厤 patient["compatible_agents"].
+        limit: 杩斿洖鏉℃暟涓婇檺.
+        only_compatible: True 鏃舵棤鍏煎鎮ｈ€呰繑鍥?[] (涓嶅洖閫€鍏ㄩ噺).
+    """
+    if not PATIENTS_FILE.exists():
+        logger.warning("patients.json 涓嶅瓨鍦? %s", PATIENTS_FILE)
+        return []
+    try:
+        data = json.loads(PATIENTS_FILE.read_text(encoding="utf-8"))
+    except (OSError, json.JSONDecodeError) as e:
+        logger.warning("patients.json 鍔犺浇澶辫触: %s", e)
+        return []
+    all_pts = data.get("patients", []) if isinstance(data, dict) else data
+    if not isinstance(all_pts, list):
+        logger.warning("patients.json 椤跺眰缁撴瀯寮傚父: %s", type(all_pts).__name__)
+        return []
+    matched = [p for p in all_pts if agent_name in p.get("compatible_agents", [])]
+    if matched:
+        return matched[:limit]
+    if only_compatible:
